# Authoritative Homebrew manifest for dots (macOS / Linuxbrew).
# Optional AI / agent-skill components live in Brewfile.<component> and are applied by:
#   ./setup.sh --with herdr,hermes,ollama,archify,drawthings
#
# Notes:
# - bash-completion@2 (conflicts with bash-completion v1)
# - moreutils (do NOT add GNU parallel — both ship `parallel`)
# - No neofetch / git-flow / tldr / openssl@1.1
# - Node is NOT in the default Brewfile; use --with archify → Brewfile.archify
# - draw-things-cli is NOT in the default Brewfile; use --with drawthings

